WP Downloader lets you save any public WP story as a formatted PDF file in seconds. Here's how.

## What you need

- A WP story URL
- A free Discord account (required for PDF generation)

## Steps

### 1. Copy the story URL

Open the story on the Wattpad website or app. Copy the URL from your browser's address bar. It will look like:

```
https://www.wattpad.com/story/123456789-story-title
```

### 2. Go to WP Downloader

Visit [wpd.my](/) and paste the story URL into the input field.

### 3. Select PDF as your format

Click the **PDF** button in the Format section. If you see "Requires sign-in", you'll need to connect your Discord account first (step 4).

### 4. Sign in with Discord

Click **Sign in with Discord** and authorise WP Downloader. You only need to do this once. Your account details are never stored beyond your session.

### 5. Click Download

Hit the **Download** button. Your PDF will be generated and downloaded to your device within seconds.

## Tips

- **Include images**: Enable the Include Images toggle to embed cover and chapter images in your PDF. This takes slightly longer.
- **Slow internet?** Leave the download running - it continues in the background.

## Troubleshooting

**The download button is greyed out** - make sure you've pasted a valid WP story URL and signed in with Discord.

**The PDF is missing chapters** - some stories have chapters locked behind login. You can use the Paid Story option if you've purchased access.

**The file won't open** - try a different PDF reader. All modern internet browsers open WP Downloader PDFs correctly.
